-        // under MOE_OTD_READBACK_NOHOIST=1 (miss-gated, same condition this
-        // function is called under) -- so a null buffer here is a caller
+        // under MOE_OTD_READBACK_NOHOIST=1 or the all-resident pool (patch
+        // 0062; miss-gated, same condition this function is called under)
+        // -- so a null buffer here is a caller
         // wiring bug, not a reachable runtime state, and is loud rather than
